---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About - Joel Stransky | Senior Software Engineer">
  <main class="w-full bg-surface-primary text-foreground-primary transition-colors duration-300">
    <div class="mx-auto px-6 md:px-24 max-w-3xl py-16 md:py-24">
      <h1 class="font-serif font-bold text-4xl md:text-5xl text-foreground-primary tracking-tight mb-12">
        About Joel Stransky
      </h1>
      
      <div class="font-sans text-base md:text-lg text-foreground-secondary leading-relaxed space-y-8">
        <p>
          I am a Senior Software Engineer specializing in performance, accessibility, and scale, with a strong design background and 15+ years producing enterprise software. My work focuses on bridging technical execution and thoughtful interface design across complex platforms, including Node.js, .NET, React, and TypeScript.
        </p>
        
        <p>
          Throughout my career, my work has shipped across diverse environments and high-profile stages—from engineering interactive installations for the IBM Watson Jeopardy! project and the Smithsonian, to developing cross-platform mobile reader applications for the Barnes & Noble Nook Color. At Konami Gaming, I revolutionized legacy Java interfaces by deploying an open-source Chromium integration framework, eliminating substantial licensing costs. At College Loan Corporation, I improved Lighthouse scores from C to A ratings, cleared thousands of legacy WCAG violations, led financial calculator development, and reduced development cycles by 40% through monorepo consolidation.
        </p>
        
        <p>
          Earlier in my career, I engineered reusable parent-theme architectures at the University of Hawaii that reduced second-site build times by 90%, developed the interactive "Roots Course" e-learning framework with xAPI/LRS integration, and modernized web infrastructures and conversion pipelines at Superb.net and Vegas.com. A Full Sail University Game Art graduate (Salutatorian), I combine visual craft and 3D graphics experience with rigorous frontend architecture, developer tooling, and agentic software engineering.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-border-subtle flex flex-wrap gap-4 items-center font-sans text-sm">
        <a
          href="/cv"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full font-bold bg-[#534aff] text-white dark:bg-accent-primary dark:text-[#060414] hover:bg-opacity-90 transition-colors shadow-sm no-underline"
        >
          View Full CV
        </a>
        <a
          href="/Joel-Stransky-Developer-Resume.pdf"
          target="_blank"
          download="Joel-Stransky-Developer-Resume.pdf"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full font-bold border border-border-card text-foreground-primary hover:bg-surface-secondary transition-colors no-underline"
        >
          Download Resume (PDF)
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
